  "details": "# Repro steps\n\n1. Subscribe VRChat+ on Android Mobile with GooglePlay payment\n\n2. Login with PC. Open Main Menu VRChat+ tab\n\n3. Press the \"Manage\" button. Then, no reaction happens.\n\n# Expectation\n\nI expected some guides or error messages to appear, at least.\n\n# Note\n\nWhen you press the button, an exception will be recorded in the log file.\n\n```\n\nException  -  Object reference not set to an instance of an object.\n\n```\n\nSo, I guess this is a coding error.",
